#: kplayer.cpp:734
msgid "Opens the KPlayer key bindings dialog"
msgstr "Abre o diálogo configuración dos atallos de teclado"

#: kplayer.cpp:735
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Configure Shortcuts command opens a dialog that lets you see and change "
#| "KPlayer's shortcut key bindings, or associations between actions and the "
#| "corresponding keys or combinations of keys that activate them. If you "
#| "change the bindings, make sure not to duplicate an existing shortcut and "
#| "also not to use the Shift key for your new shortcuts, because the Shift "
#| "key has a special function in KPlayer."
msgid ""
"The 'Configure Shortcuts' command opens a dialog that allows you to see and "
"change KPlayer's shortcut key bindings, or associations between actions and "
"the corresponding keys or combinations of keys that activate them. If you "
"change the bindings, make sure not to duplicate an existing shortcut and "
"also not to use the Shift key for your new shortcuts, because the Shift key "
"has a special function in KPlayer."
msgstr ""
"O comando Configurar os atallos abre un diálogo que lle permite ver e mudar "
"os atallo de teclado de KPlayer ou as asociacións entre accións e teclas ou "
"combinacións de teclas que as activan. Se modifica a configuración, "
"asegúrese de non duplicar un atallo existente e de non usar a tecla Maiúsc "
"para os seus atallos, dado que esta tecla ten unha función especial en "
"KPlayer."

#: kplayer.cpp:738
msgid "Opens the KPlayer toolbar configuration dialog"
msgstr "Abre o diálogo de configuración das barras de ferramentas de KPlayer"

#: kplayer.cpp:739
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Configure Toolbars command opens a dialog that lets you see and change "
#| "KPlayer's toolbars and controls assigned to them."
