"change KPlayer's toolbars and controls assigned to them."
msgstr ""
"O comando Configurar as barras de ferramentas abre un diálogo que lle "
"permite ver e alterar as barras de ferramentas de KPlayer e as accións que "
"teñen."

#: kplayer.cpp:742
msgid "Opens the KPlayer configuration dialog"
msgstr "Abre o diálogo de configuración de KPlayer"

#: kplayer.cpp:743
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Configure KPlayer command opens a dialog that lets you configure the "
#| "program, modifying various aspects of its functionality, user interface "
#| "and interaction with MPlayer. For more information see the Configuration "
#| "dialog chapter and the Advanced configuration micro-HOWTO in the user "
#| "manual."
msgid ""
"The 'Configure KPlayer' command opens a dialog that allows you to configure "
"the program, modifying various aspects of its functionality, user interface "
"and interaction with MPlayer. For more information see the Configuration "
"dialog chapter and the Advanced configuration micro-HOWTO in the user manual."
msgstr ""
"O comando Configurar KPlayer abre un diálogo que lle permite configurar o "
"programa, modificando varios aspeitos da sua funcionalidade, da interface e "
"da interacción con MPlayer. Para máis información, consulte o capítulo do "
"diálogo de Configuración e o micro-HOWTO de configuración avanzada no manual "
